/S /H2
/P 108 0 R
/T (The DPPC Oversight Unit is responsible for monitoring all 19C investigations. Every case, whether investigated by DPPC, DDS, DMH or MassAbility, is monitored by one of DPPC's Oversight Officers to ensure that the victim is safe, the report is timely and the investigation is thorough. In cases where abuse by a caregiver has been substantiated, protective services are provided by the respective service-providing agency, DDS, DMH or MassAbility. To confirm that necessary protective services are implemented, the DPPC Oversight Officers monitor cases until risk of harm to the victim is adequately reduced or eliminated. )
/E (The DPPC Oversight Unit is responsible for monitoring all 19C investigations. Every case, whether investigated by DPPC, DDS, DMH or MassAbility, is monitored by one of DPPC's Oversight Officers to ensure that the victim is safe, the report is timely and the investigation is thorough. In cases where abuse by a caregiver has been substantiated, protective services are provided by the respective service-providing agency, DDS, DMH or MassAbility. To confirm that necessary protective services are implemented, the DPPC Oversight Officers monitor cases until risk of harm to the victim is adequately reduced or eliminated. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
